<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1540718157034164295 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1540718157034164295><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Saturday, August 22, 2026 9:43 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1540718157034164295>8/22/2026 9:43 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>真正的财富是人 <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128173;"
    title="thought_balloon"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f4ad.svg"><img
